{title: 651 - Happy the Home That Welcomes You}
{subtitle: SDA Hymnal #651 • WELWYN • 12.8.12.10}
{lyricist: Karl J. P. Spitta}
{composer: Alfred Scott-Gatty}
{key: F}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: Moderato}
{meta: hymn_number 651}
{meta: tune WELWYN}
{meta: meter 12.8.12.10}
{meta: category Christian Home - }

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[F]Happy [Gm]the home [F]that [Gm/D]welcomes [Dm/A]You, [C/G]Lord [F]Jesus,
[Am]Truest [Dm/A]of [Gm]friends, [C/G]most [Am]honored [Gm]of [Am]all,
[Am]Where hearts [F]and [Dm/A]eyes [C/G]are [F]bright [Gm/D]wit [Gbm]h [Gm]joy to [F]greet [C]You,
[C7]Your lightest [Bb]wishes [C]eager [F/C]to [Gm/D]fulfill.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[F]Happy [Gm]the [C/G]home [F]where [Gm/D]man [Gbm]and [Gm]wife [Dm/A]together
[Am]Are of [Dm/A]one [Gm]mind [C/G]believing [Gm]in [Am]Your [C]love:
[Am]Through love [F]and [Dm/A]pain, [C/G]prosperity [Gm]and hardship,
[C7]Through good [F/C]and [Bb]evil [C]days [Gm/D]Your [F/C]care [Gm/D]they [F/C]prove.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
[F]Happy [Gm]the [C/G]home, [F]O [Gm/D]loving Friend [Dm/A]of [F]children,
[Am]Where they [Dm/A]are [Gm]giv'n [C/G]to [Am]you [Gm]with hands [Am]of [C]prayer,
[Am]Where at [F]Your [Dm/A]feet [C/G]they [F]early [Gbm]learn [Gm]to listen
[C7]To Your [F/C]own [Bb]Words, [Gm]and [C]thank [Gm/D]You [F/C]for [Gm/D]your [F/C]care
{end_of_verse}
